  "semantics": [
    "Normalization scans ordered absolute maxima with native repeated sign comparisons, caps encoded maximum at0x3ca3d70a, and clears output when below0x33d6bf95. Exact lower threshold proceeds to division.",
    "The output pass clips sequential live input values and preserves native carry/GT behavior on unordered comparisons. Forward aliasing can change later samples; it is deliberately retained. Sign negation uses defined bit operations. Actual source __aeabi_memclr and hardware VDIV execute.",
    "Tensor descriptor is five words: element bytes,batches,rows,columns,data pointer. Native R0 returns data pointer, not descriptor. The implementation preserves all raw dimension/data bits.",
    "No new assembly, executable arrays or allocated writable sections are added. All prior909 nongenerated source/object pairs are unchanged.",
    "These are qualified dependencies of the inference path. The unresolved parent r1_goodix_spo2_infer is not replaced or bypassed. Generated graph0x37890, subgraph0x34194 and operator callback providers remain implementation work."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Inference remains unresolved; no end-to-end neural-network result or full graph coverage is claimed. Imports remain82 application/22 boot in relocatable composition, not a complete bootable image.",
    "Independent finite normalization oracles run under nearest rounding; exact native comparisons cover all32 FP configurations.",
    "Public RAM and full FPSCR are compared, excluding8192 bytes below incoming SP. Saved R4-R11/S16-S31, SP and interrupt masks are checked. Caller-clobbered registers are not promised except tensor R0.",
    "Pipeline tests append input normalization and tensor setup to real constructor/queue/ratio/summary/quality/transition processing. Prior filter classification is supplied as explicit input; model inference is not simulated.",
    "Paired pushes check saved registers/SP per call. Full public RAM/FPSCR snapshots occur at constructors and processing-stage boundaries, not after every push.",
    "Physical hardware, trap configuration, timing and interrupt concurrency are untested. Preexisting dependent units may still contain assembly. All214 body bytes execute; input/interleaving coverage is not exhaustive.",
    "REA dossiers are retained analysis snapshots. Locked raw instructions execute for native replay."
  ],
